  "checklist": [
    "I use se + verb for general statements and signs (se vende, se habla).",
    "I make the verb agree with the thing: se venden casas.",
    "I describe accidents with se me cayó, se me olvidó, se nos acabó.",
    "I tell the different kinds of se apart."
  ],
